Additional evaluation evidence for the Delegated Authorization manuscript

Baseline repository commit: 4f6695a5efc40b7e168abff1223e61fcbf2c058a

Deeper branching configuration
Copy implementation/supplement/check_deep_branches.py into the same
directory in a checkout of the baseline. From the repository root, run
python3 implementation/supplement/check_deep_branches.py.
The script writes deep_branches_results.json. The two existing tool
capabilities were retained.

Rodin timings
The supplied Java source adds a System.nanoTime measurement around
each AutoProver call. Put it at the same path in a disposable checkout,
then follow the baseline README's clean headless replay instructions.
rodin_timed/ contains the log and collector summary from the run.
The reported total is the sum of the AUTOPROVER_NS values.

Additional ProB searches
Each directory contains the Event-B model exported from the corresponding
statically checked Rodin variant, the ProB log, and the concrete trace.
For each model, take the exact goal from additional_goals/summary.json
and pass it to ProB CLI 1.16.1 as GOAL in the command below. Run from
the respective variant directory.

probcli model.eventb -model_check -nodead -p MAX_OPERATIONS 1000 \
  -p NUMBER_OF_ANIMATED_ABSTRACTIONS 0 -p PROOF_INFO false \
  -goal "$GOAL" -bf -his rerun_trace.json -his_option json -his_option show_states

The two previously reported ProB witnesses are in the baseline artifact.
